{
    "title": "Beauty Camera - Sweet Camera",
    "description": "<b>Beauty Camera - Selfie Camera helps you easily create beautiful and natural looking photos and video selfies with with auto- beautifying tools, trendy makeup, cool ar stickers, various filters.</b> Beauty Selfie Camera comes with powerful editing tools and auto-beautification tool, including top makeup, funny face sticker, sweet AR sticker, retouch face/body, various camera filters, music video.\r\n\r\n<b>Beauty Camera, the popular selfie camera and beauty editor can instantly take perfect selfies with stunning photo filters, cute or cool stickers, pretty makeup, amazing posters and grid styles.</b> Body reshaping tools allow you to get the results you want easily. Get perfect photos in a snap and manually edit the way you want to make every moment more special.\r\n<b>Beauty Camera is also a HD Selfie Camera, photo & video editing app and photo collage maker to touch-up your photos in just one tap:</b> smooth and whiten skin, live makeup, remove acne or pimples, erasing dark circles and brightening eyes, teeth whitening, plumping your lips, body and face reshaping tools and more! \r\n\r\nBeauty Camera - HD Camera and makeup camera gives yourself a full virtual makeover and let\u2019s take perfect selfie and video even boomerang for Instagram, Facebook, TikTok, Messenger, Whatsapp, Snapchat, Twitter. Meet trendy motion stickers, beauty makeup and effects! \ud83d\ude0d\ud83d\udc84\r\n\r\n\ud83d\udc96 <b>Beauty Camera for Sweet Selfies with Perfect Effect</b> \ud83d\udc8b\r\n- <b>Take Best Photos or Videos:</b> Smart recognition technology makes your photos or videos beautiful\r\n- <b>Get Flawless Skin:</b> Easy to refine your pores, remove blemishes and erase pimples\t\r\n- <b>Reshape Face:</b> Change your face shape and create your custom beauty style\r\n- <b>AR Filters:</b> Diversified styles including cat ears, pretty flower crowns, or hilarious emoji \r\n- <b>Lipstick and Blush:</b> Different Lipsticks like matte, metallic, shine and one-tap face tune\r\n- <b>AR Stickers:</b> Daily updated with adorable AR stickers to add fun to your photo\r\n- <b>Beauty tools:</b> Drag to adjust eyes, nose, lips, cheek. Teeth whitener, brightening your smile and more.\r\n\r\n\ud83d\udd25 <b>Trendy Makeup, Filters, Stickers</b> \r\n- <b>Makeup editor:</b> lipstick, blush, eyeliner, eyelashes, contour, eyebrows, facial, cosplay makeup, costume makeup. \r\n- <b>Eye Makeup:</b> Try the best cosmetics from top brand beauty products. \r\n- <b>Amazing Filters:</b> Free-to-use filters for attractive effects and the style that matches your feelings. Art filters, sparkle filter, film filter and cute funny face filters, including dog filter, cat filter, rabbit filter...\r\n- <b>Selfie Stickers:</b> Thousands of face effects, cartoons, emoji and stickers to swap faces.\r\nBeauty Selfie Cam use various popular makeup selfie effects and facial recognition stickers make your selfies mesmerizing.\r\n\r\n\ud83c\udf1f <b>Powerful Editing Tools and Music Video Maker</b>\r\n- <b>Selfie and Body Editor:</b> Using the slim tool, such as waist, arm, face, legs, and more to adjust any part of your body into perfect shape.\r\n- <b>Music Video & Sweet Snap:</b> Shoot a short video with music to get many likes or turn it into a GIF emoji.\r\n- <b>Makeup Camera & Accessories:</b> sunglasses, hats, eyewear, hairbands, earrings, necklaces in Selfie Camera\r\n\r\n\ud83d\udcf8 <b>Professional Photo Editor and Photo Collage</b>\r\n- <b>Crop:</b> Simply adjust the size and ratio. Resize and trim with this photo editor\r\n- <b>Amazing Collage or Frame:</b> Collage templates, backgrounds, frames, fonts, filters for Instagram stories\r\n- <b>Background Eraser:</b> Object removal tool help you eraser the unwanted part of your photo\r\n- <b>Photo Repair:</b> Fix your old blurry photos and increase image resolution\r\n- <b>Smart Adjust:</b> One tap to add blur effect and adjust contrast, saturation, temperature, vignette, fade, shadow, and more.\r\n\r\nLet's download Beauty Camera - Sweet Camera, Selfie Editor to take HD photos or videos and edit them with unique filters, AR stickers and makeup! \ud83c\udf08\ud83c\udfac",
    "descriptionHTML": "<b>Beauty Camera - Selfie Camera helps you easily create beautiful and natural looking photos and video selfies with with auto- beautifying tools, trendy makeup, cool ar stickers, various filters.</b> Beauty Selfie Camera comes with powerful editing tools and auto-beautification tool, including top makeup, funny face sticker, sweet AR sticker, retouch face/body, various camera filters, music video.<br><br><b>Beauty Camera, the popular selfie camera and beauty editor can instantly take perfect selfies with stunning photo filters, cute or cool stickers, pretty makeup, amazing posters and grid styles.</b> Body reshaping tools allow you to get the results you want easily. Get perfect photos in a snap and manually edit the way you want to make every moment more special.<br><b>Beauty Camera is also a HD Selfie Camera, photo &amp; video editing app and photo collage maker to touch-up your photos in just one tap:</b> smooth and whiten skin, live makeup, remove acne or pimples, erasing dark circles and brightening eyes, teeth whitening, plumping your lips, body and face reshaping tools and more! <br><br>Beauty Camera - HD Camera and makeup camera gives yourself a full virtual makeover and let\u2019s take perfect selfie and video even boomerang for Instagram, Facebook, TikTok, Messenger, Whatsapp, Snapchat, Twitter. Meet trendy motion stickers, beauty makeup and effects! \ud83d\ude0d\ud83d\udc84<br><br>\ud83d\udc96 <b>Beauty Camera for Sweet Selfies with Perfect Effect</b> \ud83d\udc8b<br>- <b>Take Best Photos or Videos:</b> Smart recognition technology makes your photos or videos beautiful<br>- <b>Get Flawless Skin:</b> Easy to refine your pores, remove blemishes and erase pimples\t<br>- <b>Reshape Face:</b> Change your face shape and create your custom beauty style<br>- <b>AR Filters:</b> Diversified styles including cat ears, pretty flower crowns, or hilarious emoji <br>- <b>Lipstick and Blush:</b> Different Lipsticks like matte, metallic, shine and one-tap face tune<br>- <b>AR Stickers:</b> Daily updated with adorable AR stickers to add fun to your photo<br>- <b>Beauty tools:</b> Drag to adjust eyes, nose, lips, cheek. Teeth whitener, brightening your smile and more.<br><br>\ud83d\udd25 <b>Trendy Makeup, Filters, Stickers</b> <br>- <b>Makeup editor:</b> lipstick, blush, eyeliner, eyelashes, contour, eyebrows, facial, cosplay makeup, costume makeup. <br>- <b>Eye Makeup:</b> Try the best cosmetics from top brand beauty products. <br>- <b>Amazing Filters:</b> Free-to-use filters for attractive effects and the style that matches your feelings. Art filters, sparkle filter, film filter and cute funny face filters, including dog filter, cat filter, rabbit filter...<br>- <b>Selfie Stickers:</b> Thousands of face effects, cartoons, emoji and stickers to swap faces.<br>Beauty Selfie Cam use various popular makeup selfie effects and facial recognition stickers make your selfies mesmerizing.<br><br>\ud83c\udf1f <b>Powerful Editing Tools and Music Video Maker</b><br>- <b>Selfie and Body Editor:</b> Using the slim tool, such as waist, arm, face, legs, and more to adjust any part of your body into perfect shape.<br>- <b>Music Video &amp; Sweet Snap:</b> Shoot a short video with music to get many likes or turn it into a GIF emoji.<br>- <b>Makeup Camera &amp; Accessories:</b> sunglasses, hats, eyewear, hairbands, earrings, necklaces in Selfie Camera<br><br>\ud83d\udcf8 <b>Professional Photo Editor and Photo Collage</b><br>- <b>Crop:</b> Simply adjust the size and ratio. Resize and trim with this photo editor<br>- <b>Amazing Collage or Frame:</b> Collage templates, backgrounds, frames, fonts, filters for Instagram stories<br>- <b>Background Eraser:</b> Object removal tool help you eraser the unwanted part of your photo<br>- <b>Photo Repair:</b> Fix your old blurry photos and increase image resolution<br>- <b>Smart Adjust:</b> One tap to add blur effect and adjust contrast, saturation, temperature, vignette, fade, shadow, and more.<br><br>Let&#39;s download Beauty Camera - Sweet Camera, Selfie Editor to take HD photos or videos and edit them with unique filters, AR stickers and makeup! \ud83c\udf08\ud83c\udfac",
